flowchart TD
  classDef works fill:#ffffff,stroke:#b8babe,color:#3a3e44;
  classDef friction fill:#f6f7f7,stroke:#3a3e44,stroke-width:2px,color:#3a3e44;
  classDef broken fill:#ffffff,stroke:#c4362b,stroke-width:2px,color:#c4362b;
  S1["1. More in the sidebar (desktop) or Settings<br/>(phone), Import, pick a browser bookmarks file.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S2["2. While it runs nothing shows: no progress,<br/>Import stays live for a second click, the empty<br/>Dashboard stays empty. A 20 MB file takes about<br/>15 seconds.<br/><i>friction</i>"]:::friction
  S3["3. Done: 'Imported 15, skipped 0', folders kept.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S4["4. The same file again: 'Imported 0, skipped 15'.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S5["5. A file that is not a bookmarks file: 'Not a<br/>bookmark file.'; folders more than 256 deep:<br/>'The folders in this file nest more than 256<br/>deep. Pinned cannot import it.'<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S6["6. Export downloads bookmarks.html.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S7["7. With a folder locked in this browser the export<br/>leaves it out and says nothing; someone moving<br/>away or keeping a copy loses those links<br/>without knowing.<br/><i>friction</i>"]:::friction
  S8["8. The nightly export/bookmarks.html in the data<br/>folder holds everything, locked folders too.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S1 --> S2
  S2 --> S3
  S3 --> S4
  S4 --> S5
  S5 --> S6
  S6 --> S7
  S7 --> S8
